{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tired of normal games? Then you can have a wonderful time not spending it on this game!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3549230/extras/64416f151e091b40f9465257cd44577f.poster.avif?t=1764915837\" width=608 height=174 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3549230/extras/64416f151e091b40f9465257cd44577f.webm?t=1764915837\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3549230/extras/64416f151e091b40f9465257cd44577f.mp4?t=1764915837\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No gameplay and no plot! Only microtransactions and fees for jumps and slides.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3549230/extras/7f6c25591326b1d8a6d9438be3303894.poster.avif?t=1764915837\" width=608 height=174 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3549230/extras/7f6c25591326b1d8a6d9438be3303894.webm?t=1764915837\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3549230/extras/7f6c25591326b1d8a6d9438be3303894.mp4?t=1764915837\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shooter, madness, puzzles, lul, easter eggs YES! ... and when not yes? </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3549230/extras/d61742c52d96ebf9357f6699aa136fb0.poster.avif?t=1764915837\" width=608 height=174 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets